# Optional: turns on the live Claude-powered AURA Copilot.
# Without it the copilot runs on AURA's built-in on-device engine (still grounded, works offline).
# Set these in Vercel -> Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables, or in .env.local for `npm run dev`.
# NEVER prefix with VITE_: the key must stay on the server.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
# COPILOT_ALLOWED_ORIGIN=https://your-site.vercel.app
